  m_Name: SSO_Log_Raj_First
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Header: To all subsequent Saviors!
  Body: "If you are reading this, it means I have likely failed to reach the bottom.
    My first stop will be the tree's roots\r\n\r\nThanks to the Tower\u2019s divine
    powers, you should have the knowledge of our previous attempts. With that in
    mind, you better be the one to reach the bottom and save our people. (\u2190
    No pressure!)\n\nRajanii"
  IsDiscovered: 1
